# Week 1 Lab — Python Foundations

## Introduction to Big Data Analytics

This repository contains my **Week 1 Python Foundations Lab** for the **Introduction to Big Data Analytics** course at **Adventist University of Central Africa (AUCA)**.

The lab introduces the basic Python concepts needed for working with data and performing simple data analysis.

