## Learning Objectives

In this lab, I practiced:

* Python variables and data types
* Type conversion
* Strings and f-strings
* String manipulation
* Lists
* Basic descriptive statistics
* Dictionaries
* Working with structured student data
* Counting categories
* Finding minimum and maximum values
* Basic dataset analysis

## Lab Structure

### Part 0 — Warm-Up

* Created a Jupyter/Google Colab notebook
* Printed a simple Python message

### Part 1 — Variables & Data Types

* Created variables using:

  * `str`
  * `int`
  * `float`
  * `bool`
* Checked variable types
* Converted text into an integer
* Practiced understanding strings and numbers
