### Part 5 — Class Dataset Analysis

Analyzed a dataset containing **20 AUCA students**.

The analysis included:

* Number of students
* Average score
* Highest and lowest scores
* Score range
* Inspecting individual student records
* Counting students by district
* Identifying the top-scoring student
* Identifying the lowest-scoring student
